meta {
  name: Delete Chat
  type: http
  seq: 5
}

delete {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/chats/{{chatId}}
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Origin: {{clientUrl}}
}

docs {
  Immediate and permanent, taking its messages with it. There is no trash for
  chats.

  Skip this on a sequential run — it removes the chat the requests above use.

  The spend it caused stays in the ledger. Those rows reference the message with
  ON DELETE SET NULL rather than CASCADE, so deleting a chat cannot erase the
  record of what it cost.
}
